# ── Module 5 — Gemini BYOK (optional) ──
# System fallback pool — set ONE of these on the server (.env.local / Vercel env).
# Leave empty to run heuristic-only (no Gemini calls, zero external dependency).
# Single key:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...
# Or pool (comma-separated). NOTE: Gemini quota is PER GOOGLE CLOUD PROJECT, not per key.
# A pool only increases effective throughput if keys belong to DISTINCT projects.
# Same-project pool = redundancy only (revoked-key fallback), not extra quota.
# See README Module 5 § Key Topology for honest guidance.
# GEMINI_API_KEYS=AIza...,AIza...,AIza...
# All GEMINI_* vars are server-only — NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_
